{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "": {
      "localizations": {},
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@\n换算的门槛：%@\n画像决定匹配半径与过时时钟检测开关；上下文取点上限 600 m / 600 s，方向取点 25–300 m / 600 s，匹配取点上限 5 km / 180 s（都是绝对量）；点距按断档两侧原始步长（15–60 m）": {
      "comment": "Gap list: tooltip on the sampling-profile line. %1$@ = profile summary (e.g. device type + typical step), %2$@ = derived thresholds; then a fixed paragraph on what the profile controls",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@\nAbgeleitete Schwellen: %2$@\nDas Profil bestimmt den Abgleichsradius und ob die Erkennung veralteter Uhrzeit aktiv ist; Kontextpunkte bis 600 m / 600 s, Richtungspunkte 25–300 m / 600 s, Abgleichspunkte bis 5 km / 180 s (alles absolute Werte); der Punktabstand richtet sich nach der ursprünglichen Schrittweite beiderseits der Lücke (15–60 m)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@\nDerived thresholds: %2$@\nThe profile sets the match radius and whether stale-clock detection is on; context points up to 600 m / 600 s, direction points 25–300 m / 600 s, match points up to 5 km / 180 s (all absolute); point spacing follows the original step on both sides of the gap (15–60 m)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@\n換算的門檻：%2$@\n畫像決定匹配半徑與過時時鐘偵測開關；上下文取點上限 600 m / 600 s，方向取點 25–300 m / 600 s，匹配取點上限 5 km / 180 s（都是絕對量）；點距按斷檔兩側原始步長（15–60 m）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@（%@）": {
      "comment": "Precise mode: one router's result in a conflict row. Placeholders: router name (OSRM / Valhalla), route length (e.g. 1.2 km), route method (Match / Context / Constrained / Direct)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$@ (%3$@)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$@ (%3$@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$@（%3$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ ms · %lld 块 · %@ MB/s": {
      "comment": "Performance panel, parse row: %1$@ = parse time in ms, %2$lld = number of chunks parsed in parallel, %3$@ = throughput in MB/s",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ ms · Blöcke: %2$lld · %3$@ MB/s"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ ms · chunks: %2$lld · %3$@ MB/s"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ ms · %2$lld 塊 · %3$@ MB/s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ ms · %lld 块并行": {
      "comment": "Performance panel, parse row: %1$@ = parse time in ms, %2$lld = number of chunks parsed in parallel",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ ms · %2$lld-fach parallel"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ ms · %2$lld-way parallel"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ ms · %2$lld 塊平行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ ~ %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ – %2$@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
