    "A 离路 %@ m：补点起始 %@ m 内渐进靠到 A（不画垂直于路的急拐）": {
      "comment": "Taper note: anchor A is off the road, so the start of the filled path bends gradually towards A instead of a sharp perpendicular kink. 1st = A's distance from the road in m, 2nd = taper length in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A liegt %1$@ m abseits der Straße: die Lückenfüllung nähert sich auf den ersten %2$@ m allmählich an A an (kein scharfer Knick quer zur Straße)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A is %1$@ m off the road: the filled path eases toward A over its first %2$@ m (no sharp kink perpendicular to the road)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 離路 %1$@ m：補點起始 %2$@ m 內漸進靠到 A（不畫垂直於路的急拐）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 标准底图不画隧道：补在隧道里的点看着在路外，切 OpenStreetMap 或打开「叠加 OSM 隧道」可见隧道线": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Apple-Standardkarte zeichnet keine Tunnel: In einem Tunnel ergänzte Punkte wirken wie neben der Straße. Auf OpenStreetMap umschalten oder „OSM-Tunnel einblenden“ einschalten, um die Tunnellinien zu sehen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple's Standard map does not draw tunnels: points filled inside a tunnel look like they are off the road. Switch to OpenStreetMap or turn on “Overlay OSM tunnels” to see the tunnel lines"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 標準底圖不畫隧道：補在隧道裡的點看起來在路外，切到 OpenStreetMap 或打開「疊加 OSM 隧道」可見隧道線"
          }
        }
