    "专用记录仪": {
      "comment": "Sampling profile source kind: dedicated GPS logger (Garmin etc.). Shown inside the sampling summary line (采样 … · 中位 …)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPS-Logger"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPS logger"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "專用記錄器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "世界迷雾模式：未探索区域盖雾，走过的地方沿轨迹擦亮（半径可调，随纬度校正；缩小后轨迹保持可见宽度）": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fog-of-World-Modus: Unerkundete Gebiete sind vernebelt, besuchte Orte werden entlang des Tracks freigelegt (Radius einstellbar, breitengradkorrigiert; beim Herauszoomen bleibt der Track sichtbar breit)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fog of World mode: unexplored areas are covered in fog, places you have been are cleared along the track (adjustable radius, latitude-corrected; the track keeps a visible width when zoomed out)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "世界迷霧模式：未探索區域蓋霧，走過的地方沿軌跡擦亮（半徑可調，隨緯度校正；縮小後軌跡保持可見寬度）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "东京": {
      "comment": "City label: Tokyo (35.68,139.69)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokio"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokyo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "東京"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两个文件完全相同": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die beiden Dateien sind identisch"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The two files are identical"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩個檔案完全相同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两个文件的点集差异：各自独有的点高亮，其余变灰（多重集匹配：坐标 ≈0.1m + 秒级时间）": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unterschiede der Punktmengen beider Dateien: Punkte, die nur in einer Datei vorkommen, werden hervorgehoben, der Rest ausgegraut (Multimengen-Abgleich: Koordinaten ≈0,1 m + sekundengenaue Zeit)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Point-set differences between the two files: points unique to either file are highlighted, the rest are grayed out (multiset match: coordinates ≈0.1 m + time to the second)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩個檔案的點集差異：各自獨有的點醒目標示，其餘變灰（多重集匹配：座標 ≈0.1m + 秒級時間）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两个服务给出的坐标逐点相同（都用同一份 OpenStreetMap 数据），切换看不出差别是正常的": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Dienste haben Punkt für Punkt identische Koordinaten geliefert (sie nutzen dieselben OpenStreetMap-Daten); dass beim Umschalten kein Unterschied zu sehen ist, ist normal"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both services returned point-for-point identical coordinates (they use the same OpenStreetMap data), so switching shows no difference — that is expected"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩個服務給出的座標逐點相同（都用同一份 OpenStreetMap 資料），切換看不出差別是正常的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两侧没有可用于上下文/匹配的真实轨迹点（前后点太远、跨了别的断档或停车超过 600 s），结果只按两端行进方向路由": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning: no usable real track points on either side for Context/Match; the route only uses the travel direction at both ends. Glossary: 上下文 = Context, 匹配 = Match",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf keiner Seite echte Trackpunkte für Kontext/Abgleich (Nachbarpunkte zu weit, jenseits einer anderen Lücke oder Halt über 600 s); die Route folgt nur der Fahrtrichtung an beiden Enden"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No real track points usable for Context/Match on either side (neighboring points too far, across another gap, or a stop over 600 s); the route only follows the direction of travel at both ends"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩側沒有可用於上下文/匹配的真實軌跡點（前後點太遠、跨了別的斷檔或停車超過 600 s），結果只按兩端行進方向路由"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两侧没有可用的真实轨迹点（前后点太远、跨了别的断档或停车超过 600 s），结果只是两点间最短路": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning: no usable real track points on either side; the result is just the shortest path between the two points",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf keiner Seite brauchbare echte Trackpunkte (Nachbarpunkte zu weit, jenseits einer anderen Lücke oder Halt über 600 s); das Ergebnis ist nur der kürzeste Weg zwischen den zwei Punkten"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No usable real track points on either side (neighboring points too far, across another gap, or a stop over 600 s); the result is just the shortest path between the two points"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩側沒有可用的真實軌跡點（前後點太遠、跨了別的斷檔或停車超過 600 s），結果只是兩點間最短路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两点之间没有可行驶路径": {
      "comment": "No-route reason: there is no drivable path between the two points",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein befahrbarer Weg zwischen den beiden Punkten"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No drivable path between the two points"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩點之間沒有可行駛路徑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两端各查离最近公路（OSRM）和最近铁路（Overpass）的距离：都贴铁路且不贴公路算铁路，都贴公路且离铁路远算公路，否则留给你选。每处 4 次请求，Overpass 约 2 秒一次": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüft für beide Enden den Abstand zur nächsten Straße (OSRM) und zur nächsten Bahnstrecke (Overpass): beide an der Bahn und nicht an der Straße gilt als Bahn, beide an der Straße und weit von der Bahn gilt als Straße, sonst wählen Sie selbst. 4 Anfragen pro Stelle, Overpass etwa eine alle 2 Sekunden"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks the distance from each end to the nearest road (OSRM) and the nearest railway (Overpass): both ends on rail and off road counts as rail, both on road and far from rail counts as road, otherwise it is left for you to choose. 4 requests per gap; Overpass about one every 2 seconds"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩端各查離最近公路（OSRM）和最近鐵路（Overpass）的距離：都貼鐵路且不貼公路算鐵路，都貼公路且離鐵路遠算公路，否則留給你選。每處 4 次請求，Overpass 約 2 秒一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两端吸附 %@ m / %@ m": {
      "comment": "Route status tooltip line: distance from anchor A / anchor B to where the route snapped onto the road network; %1$@ / %2$@ = metres",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einrastabstand der Enden %1$@ m / %2$@ m"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End snap distance %1$@ m / %2$@ m"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩端吸附 %1$@ m / %2$@ m"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两端都在 300 米内的其它断档，用同一条折线一次补完": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andere Lücken, deren beide Enden innerhalb von 300 m liegen, in einem Zug mit derselben Polylinie füllen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fill other gaps with both ends within 300 m in one go, using the same polyline"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩端都在 300 公尺內的其他斷檔，用同一條折線一次補完"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两端都在 300 米内的断档会用同一条折线（反向自动倒序）补上，锚点取各自的两端；一次重建，可整批撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lücken, deren beide Enden innerhalb von 300 m liegen, werden mit derselben Polylinie gefüllt (bei Gegenrichtung automatisch umgekehrt), Anker sind jeweils die eigenen Enden; ein einziger Neuaufbau, als Ganzes rückgängig zu machen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gaps with both ends within 300 m are filled with the same polyline (reversed automatically for the opposite direction), each using its own ends as anchors; rebuilt once, undoable as a batch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩端都在 300 公尺內的斷檔會用同一條折線（反向自動倒序）補上，錨點取各自的兩端；一次重建，可整批撤銷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两端都落在对向车道那一边，路线可能吸错车道": {
      "comment": "Driving-side check verdict (after an arrow): points at both ends are on the opposite-carriageway side; the route may be on the wrong carriageway",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Enden liegen auf der Seite der Gegenfahrbahn; die Route ist evtl. auf der falschen Fahrbahn eingerastet"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both ends fall on the opposite-carriageway side; the route may have snapped to the wrong carriageway"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩端都落在對向車道那一邊，路線可能吸錯車道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两端附近没有铁路（A 最近 %@ m，B 最近 %@ m）": {
      "comment": "Rail routing error. 1st = distance from anchor A to the nearest railway in m, 2nd = same for anchor B (may be \"inf\")",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Bahnstrecke nahe den Enden (nächste: %1$@ m von A, %2$@ m von B)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No railway near the ends (nearest: %1$@ m from A, %2$@ m from B)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩端附近沒有鐵路（A 最近 %1$@ m，B 最近 %2$@ m）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两路一致": {
      "comment": "Route status clause (single-gap cross-check): OSRM and Valhalla agree",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Dienste stimmen überein"
          }
