        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩路一致 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两路一致（最多相差 %lld m）": {
      "comment": "Route evidence: both routers agree; %lld = max deviation in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Dienste einig (höchstens %lld m Abstand)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both services agree (at most %lld m apart)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩路一致（最多相差 %lld m）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两路一致，但补点末尾段向 B 靠拢了 %@ m、远多于 B 离路的 %@ m：末尾几何可能不是路网，请在地图上看一眼": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning (precise mode): both routers agree, but the end of the filled path was bent towards anchor B much more than B's distance from the road; the end geometry may not follow the road network. 1st = taper offset in m, 2nd = B's distance from the road in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Dienste stimmen überein, aber das Ende der Lückenfüllung wurde %1$@ m zu B hingezogen, weit mehr als die %2$@ m, die B neben der Straße liegt: Die Endgeometrie ist womöglich kein Straßennetz. Bitte auf der Karte prüfen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both services agree, but the end of the filled path was pulled %1$@ m toward B, far more than B's %2$@ m off the road: the end geometry may not be road network; please check on the map"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩路一致，但補點末尾段向 B 靠攏了 %1$@ m、遠多於 B 離路的 %2$@ m：末尾幾何可能不是路網，請在地圖上看一眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两路一致，但补点起始段向 A 靠拢了 %@ m、远多于 A 离路的 %@ m：起始几何可能不是路网，请在地图上看一眼": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning (precise mode): both routers agree, but the start of the filled path was bent towards anchor A much more than A's distance from the road; the start geometry may not follow the road network. 1st = taper offset in m, 2nd = A's distance from the road in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Dienste stimmen überein, aber der Anfang der Lückenfüllung wurde %1$@ m zu A hingezogen, weit mehr als die %2$@ m, die A neben der Straße liegt: Die Anfangsgeometrie ist womöglich kein Straßennetz. Bitte auf der Karte prüfen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both services agree, but the start of the filled path was pulled %1$@ m toward A, far more than A's %2$@ m off the road: the start geometry may not be road network; please check on the map"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩路一致，但補點起始段向 A 靠攏了 %1$@ m、遠多於 A 離路的 %2$@ m：起始幾何可能不是路網，請在地圖上看一眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两路一致，但锚点离路 %@ / %@ m：两个服务用同一份地图和同一组锚点，锚点本身漂到旁边路上时会一起接错，请在地图上看一眼": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning (precise mode): both routers agree but an anchor is far from the road, so both may have snapped to the same wrong road. Placeholders: distance of anchor A / anchor B from the road in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Dienste stimmen überein, aber die Anker liegen %1$@ / %2$@ m neben der Straße: Beide nutzen dieselbe Karte und dieselben Anker; ist ein Anker auf eine Nachbarstraße gedriftet, irren sich beide gemeinsam. Bitte auf der Karte prüfen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both services agree, but the anchors are %1$@ / %2$@ m off the road: both use the same map and the same anchors, so if an anchor drifted onto a neighbouring road they are wrong together; please check on the map"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩路一致，但錨點離路 %1$@ / %2$@ m：兩個服務用同一份地圖和同一組錨點，錨點本身漂到旁邊路上時會一起接錯，請在地圖上看一眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两路一致：%@ %@，最多相差 %lld m；采用 %@": {
      "comment": "Cross-check note when OSRM and Valhalla agree. Placeholders: name of the other router, its route length (e.g. 1.21 km), maximum deviation in m, name of the adopted router. Keep router names untranslated",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide einig: %1$@ %2$@, höchstens %3$lld m Abstand; verwendet wird %4$@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both agree: %1$@ %2$@, at most %3$lld m apart; using %4$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩路一致：%1$@ %2$@，最多相差 %3$lld m；採用 %4$@"
