    "修改记录 %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Änderungsprotokoll (%lld)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change Log (%lld)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改記錄 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "候选（绕路比 = 路网长 / 直线，长度不含两端贴路）：%@；相差 ≤%@ m（直线的 5%%，至少 40 m）算平手，按 匹配 > 上下文 > 约束 > 直接 取；贴路超过 %@ m 的匹配/上下文不参选": {
      "comment": "Routing note explaining the candidate choice. 1st = list of \"method ratio\" pairs (e.g. \"匹配 1.05、上下文 1.10\"), 2nd = tie tolerance in m, 3rd = maximum snap distance in m. Contains a literal %. Method names must follow the glossary: 匹配 = Match, 上下文 = Context, 约束 = Constrained, 直接 = Direct",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kandidaten (Umwegfaktor = Routenlänge / Luftlinie, ohne Straßenanbindung an beiden Enden): %1$@; ein Unterschied von ≤%2$@ m (5%% der Luftlinie, mind. 40 m) gilt als Gleichstand, dann Abgleich > Kontext > Eingeschränkt > Direkt; Abgleich/Kontext mit mehr als %3$@ m Anbindung scheiden aus"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Candidates (detour ratio = route length / straight line, excluding the snap to the road at both ends): %1$@; a difference of ≤%2$@ m (5%% of the straight line, at least 40 m) is a tie, broken as Match > Context > Constrained > Direct; Match/Context candidates snapping more than %3$@ m are excluded"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "候選（繞路比 = 路網長 / 直線，長度不含兩端貼路）：%@；相差 ≤%@ m（直線的 5%%，至少 40 m）算平手，按 匹配 > 上下文 > 約束 > 直接 取；貼路超過 %@ m 的匹配/上下文不參選"
          }
        }
      }
    },
