    "其中 %lld 个点位置在路线上、只是时间滞后：「替换」会保留它们的位置，时间按出口速度回推。": {
      "comment": "Apply-fill confirmation paragraph (stale-clock exit points kept with corrected time); %lld = number of points whose position lies on the route and only the timestamp lags: Replace keeps their position and recomputes the time from the exit speed. the bracketed term is this dialog's Replace button",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld davon liegt auf der Route, nur sein Zeitstempel hinkt nach: „Ersetzen“ behält seine Position und berechnet die Zeit aus der Austrittsgeschwindigkeit neu."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld davon liegen auf der Route, nur ihre Zeitstempel hinken nach: „Ersetzen“ behält ihre Position und berechnet die Zeit aus der Austrittsgeschwindigkeit neu."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of them lies on the route and only its timestamp lags: “Replace” keeps its position and recomputes the time from the exit speed."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of them lie on the route and only their timestamps lag: “Replace” keeps their positions and recomputes the times from the exit speed."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中 %lld 個點位置在路線上、只是時間滯後：「替換」會保留它們的位置，時間按出口速度回推。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其中 %lld 个点沿 A→B 单调推进、车速合理（两路定位交替时真的那一路）：「替换」会把它们保留下来，只删来回跳的。": {
      "comment": "Apply-fill confirmation paragraph (jitter, delete only); %lld = number of points that advance monotonically from A to B at a plausible speed and are kept. the bracketed terms are this dialog's Replace / Keep buttons",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld dieser Punkte kommt stetig und mit plausibler Geschwindigkeit entlang A→B voran (die echte Reihe, wenn sich zwei Ortungsquellen abwechseln): „Ersetzen“ behält ihn und löscht nur die hin- und herspringenden."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld dieser Punkte kommen stetig und mit plausibler Geschwindigkeit entlang A→B voran (die echte Reihe, wenn sich zwei Ortungsquellen abwechseln): „Ersetzen“ behält sie und löscht nur die hin- und herspringenden."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of these points advances steadily along A→B at a plausible speed (the real series when two position sources alternate): “Replace” keeps it and only deletes the ones jumping back and forth."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of these points advance steadily along A→B at a plausible speed (the real series when two position sources alternate): “Replace” keeps them and only deletes the ones jumping back and forth."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中 %lld 個點沿 A→B 單調推進、車速合理（兩路定位交替時真的那一路）：「替換」會把它們保留下來，只刪來回跳的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其中 %lld 个点贴着折线（离路网路径 %lld m 内），是准的真实点：「替换」也会把它们保留下来，只删飘了的。": {
      "comment": "Apply-fill confirmation paragraph; first %lld = number of real points lying on the polyline that are kept, second %lld = distance tolerance in metres. the bracketed terms are this dialog's Replace / Keep buttons",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Genaue echte Punkte auf der Polylinie (höchstens %2$lld m von der Route entfernt): %1$lld. „Ersetzen“ behält auch diese und löscht nur die abgedrifteten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accurate real points lying on the polyline (within %2$lld m of the route): %1$lld. “Replace” keeps these too and only deletes the ones that drifted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中 %lld 個點貼著折線（離路網路徑 %lld m 內），是準的真實點：「替換」也會把它們保留下來，只刪飄了的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其中 %lld 处是「采样稀疏」（设备本来就隔这么久记一个点，不是信号问题），默认照常列出：补上路网可让迷雾沿路解锁": {
      "comment": "Batch gap fill step 1; %lld = number of gaps whose cause is sparse sampling; 「采样稀疏」 = the cause label shown in the 成因 (Cause) column (glossary: sparse sampling)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld davon ist „spärliche Abtastung“ (das Gerät zeichnet ohnehin so selten auf, kein Signalproblem) und wird standardmäßig normal gelistet: Wird sie entlang des Straßennetzes gefüllt, lichtet sich der Nebel entlang der Straße"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld davon sind „spärliche Abtastung“ (das Gerät zeichnet ohnehin so selten auf, kein Signalproblem) und werden standardmäßig normal gelistet: Werden sie entlang des Straßennetzes gefüllt, lichtet sich der Nebel entlang der Straße"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of them is “sparse sampling” (the device records that rarely anyway; not a signal problem) and is listed as usual by default: filling it along the road network clears the fog along the road"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of them are “sparse sampling” (the device records that rarely anyway; not a signal problem) and are listed as usual by default: filling them along the road network clears the fog along the road"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中 %lld 處是「採樣稀疏」（裝置本來就隔這麼久記一個點，不是訊號問題），預設照常列出：補上路網可讓迷霧沿路解鎖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其中未归属 %@ km²（%lld 格，海上 / 无边界数据）": {
      "localizations": {
