    "地图判断 第 %lld/%lld 处 · %@ · %lld m（查两端离最近公路、最近铁路的距离：OSRM 2 次 + Overpass 2 次）": {
      "comment": "Batch Gap Fill progress of the map check; 1st %lld = current gap number, 2nd %lld = total gaps, %@ = gap time (MM-dd HH:mm), last %lld = gap length in metres",
