    "地图：%lld 个点里 %lld 个贴铁路": {
      "comment": "Batch gap fill trip basis: decided by map; %1$lld = sampled points with rail data, %2$lld = of those, points lying on a railway",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Karte: %2$lld von %1$lld Punkten an der Bahn"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map: %2$lld of %1$lld points on rail"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地圖：%1$lld 個點裡 %2$lld 個貼鐵路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地图：这段抽了 %lld 个点，贴着铁路（≤30 m）的 %lld 个、离铁路远（≥80 m 或 150 m 内没有）的 %lld 个（离铁路中位 %@）→ %@": {
      "comment": "Batch fill trip map evidence (tooltip). 1 sampled points with railway data, 2 points within 30 m of a railway, 3 points far from any railway (≥80 m or none within 150 m), 4 median distance to railway (e.g. '12 m' or 'none within 150 m'), 5 verdict (Road/Rail/undecided)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Karte: %lld Punkte in diesem Abschnitt geprüft; an der Bahn (≤30 m): %lld; fern der Bahn (≥80 m oder keine innerhalb von 150 m): %lld (Median-Abstand zur Bahn %@) → %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map: %lld points sampled in this section; on a railway (≤30 m): %lld; far from railways (≥80 m or none within 150 m): %lld (median distance to railway %@) → %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地圖：這段抽了 %lld 個點，貼著鐵路（≤30 m）的 %lld 個、離鐵路遠（≥80 m 或 150 m 內沒有）的 %lld 個（離鐵路中位 %@）→ %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地图：铁路数据没拿到（Overpass 超时/排队），没法判；可点「重新用地图判断」再试，或手选本段": {
      "comment": "Batch fill trip map evidence (tooltip): railway data from Overpass failed (timeout/queue). 「重新用地图判断」 is the button label 'Re-check with Map'; reuse its translation",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Karte: Keine Bahndaten erhalten (Overpass-Zeitüberschreitung/Warteschlange), keine Entscheidung möglich; zum erneuten Versuch auf „Erneut per Karte prüfen“ klicken oder den Abschnitt manuell wählen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map: no railway data received (Overpass timeout/queue), can't decide; click “Re-check with Map” to try again, or choose this section manually"
