        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Punkte = Trackpunkte in der Region und Besuchstage; Nebel = freigeschaltete Zellenfläche und Level in der Region (nach Fog of World)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Points = track points inside the region and days visited; Fog = unlocked cell area and level inside the region (Fog of World method)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點 = 落在該地區的軌跡點數與到訪天數；迷霧 = 該地區內解鎖的格子面積與等級（世界迷霧口徑）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点 = 落在该地区的轨迹点数与到访天数；迷雾 = 该地区内解锁的格子面积（世界迷雾口径）与按同一公式折算的等级": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Punkte = Trackpunkte in der Region und Besuchstage; Nebel = freigeschaltete Zellenfläche in der Region (nach Fog of World) und ein nach derselben Formel umgerechnetes Level"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Points = track points inside the region and days visited; Fog = unlocked cell area inside the region (Fog of World method) and a level converted with the same formula"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點 = 落在該地區的軌跡點數與到訪天數；迷霧 = 該地區內解鎖的格子面積（世界迷霧口徑）與按同一公式折算的等級"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点一行：主地图飞到那处断档（两端设为锚点），自己看是公路还是铁路": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeile anklicken: Die Hauptkarte fliegt zu dieser Lücke (beide Enden als Anker gesetzt), damit Sie selbst sehen, ob Straße oder Bahn"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click a row: the main map flies to that gap (both ends set as anchors) so you can see for yourself whether it's road or rail"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一列：主地圖飛到那處斷檔（兩端設為錨點），自己看是公路還是鐵路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
