    "网络不好：最近 %lld 次请求 %lld 次失败（%@）；联网的功能可能取不到结果，可稍后重试": {
      "comment": "Network banner. 1st = number of recent requests, 2nd = how many of them failed, 3rd = last failure reason or host name",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schlechtes Netzwerk: %2$lld der letzten %1$lld Anfragen fehlgeschlagen (%3$@); Online-Funktionen liefern eventuell keine Ergebnisse, später erneut versuchen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poor network: %2$lld of the last %1$lld requests failed (%3$@); online features may not return results, try again later"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "網路不好：最近 %1$lld 次請求 %2$lld 次失敗（%3$@）；連網的功能可能取不到結果，可稍後重試"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网络慢：最近请求要 %@ 秒才有回应（正常 1 秒内），联网的功能会很慢": {
      "comment": "Network banner. %@ = seconds the last slow request took to answer",
      "localizations": {
