    "联网：轨迹按停车切成 %lld 段，每段抽 3–8 个行驶中的点问 OpenStreetMap 附近有没有铁路，整段定公路还是铁路（「疑似铁路」筛选与批量分类都按它）": {
      "comment": "Tooltip on the map-segmentation button; %lld = number of trip segments. The quoted term is the gap filter option “Likely Rail”.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Online: Der Track wird an Stopps in %lld Abschnitt geteilt; pro Abschnitt werden 3–8 Punkte in Fahrt bei OpenStreetMap auf nahe Bahnstrecken geprüft und der ganze Abschnitt als Straße oder Bahn eingestuft (der Filter „Vermutlich Bahn“ und die Stapeleinstufung richten sich danach)"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Online: Der Track wird an Stopps in %lld Abschnitte geteilt; pro Abschnitt werden 3–8 Punkte in Fahrt bei OpenStreetMap auf nahe Bahnstrecken geprüft und der ganze Abschnitt als Straße oder Bahn eingestuft (der Filter „Vermutlich Bahn“ und die Stapeleinstufung richten sich danach)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Online: the track is split at stops into %lld segment; in each, 3–8 points recorded while moving are checked against OpenStreetMap for nearby railways, and the whole segment is classified as road or rail (the “Likely Rail” filter and batch classification both rely on this)"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Online: the track is split at stops into %lld segments; in each, 3–8 points recorded while moving are checked against OpenStreetMap for nearby railways, and the whole segment is classified as road or rail (the “Likely Rail” filter and batch classification both rely on this)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連網：軌跡按停車切成 %lld 段，每段抽 3–8 個行駛中的點問 OpenStreetMap 附近有沒有鐵路，整段定公路還是鐵路（「疑似鐵路」篩選與批量分類都按它）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聚合块面积（世界迷雾格 ≈9.55m 的倍数）：1 格最细（≈9.55m），90000 格最粗（≈2.9km）": {
