    "补点末尾段不是路网几何（最后一个路网点离 B %@ m / 方向差 %@°），请在地图上看一眼": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning: the end of the filled path does not follow the road network. 1st = distance from the last route vertex to anchor B in m, 2nd = angle between that direction and the travel direction at B in degrees",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Ende der Lückenfüllung ist keine Straßennetz-Geometrie (letzter Routenpunkt %1$@ m von B entfernt / Richtung weicht um %2$@° ab). Bitte auf der Karte prüfen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The end of the filled path is not road-network geometry (last route vertex %1$@ m from B / heading differs by %2$@°); please check on the map"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "補點末尾段不是路網幾何（最後一個路網點離 B %1$@ m / 方向差 %2$@°），請在地圖上看一眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "补点离路网原始折线中位 %@ m（应 ≤3 m）": {
      "comment": "Plausibility reason: median distance of the synthetic points from the raw road-network polyline. %@ = median distance in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die eingefügten Punkte liegen im Median %@ m von der rohen Straßenlinie entfernt (sollte ≤3 m sein)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filled points lie a median %@ m from the raw road polyline (should be ≤3 m)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "補點離路網原始折線中位 %@ m（應 ≤3 m）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "补点离路网原始折线最远 %@ m（已扣除端部允许的 %@ m；应 ≤5 m）": {
      "comment": "Plausibility reason: the synthetic points stray from the raw road-network polyline, after subtracting the allowance near the anchor. 1st = maximum excess distance in m, 2nd = allowance subtracted at that spot in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die eingefügten Punkte weichen bis zu %1$@ m von der rohen Straßenlinie ab (nach Abzug der %2$@ m, die nahe dem Ankerpunkt erlaubt sind; sollte ≤5 m sein)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filled points stray up to %1$@ m from the raw road polyline (after subtracting the %2$@ m allowed near the anchor; should be ≤5 m)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "補點離路網原始折線最遠 %1$@ m（已扣除端部允許的 %2$@ m；應 ≤5 m）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "补点离路网原始折线最远 %@ m（应 ≤5 m）": {
      "comment": "Plausibility reason: the synthetic points stray from the raw road-network polyline. %@ = maximum distance in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die eingefügten Punkte weichen bis zu %@ m von der rohen Straßenlinie ab (sollte ≤5 m sein)"
