          }
        }
      }
    },
    "补点起始段不是路网几何（首个路网点离 A %@ m / 方向差 %@°），请在地图上看一眼": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning: the start of the filled path does not follow the road network. 1st = distance from anchor A to the first route vertex in m, 2nd = angle between that direction and the travel direction at A in degrees",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Anfang der Lückenfüllung ist keine Straßennetz-Geometrie (erster Routenpunkt %1$@ m von A entfernt / Richtung weicht um %2$@° ab). Bitte auf der Karte prüfen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
