    "起始段向 A 靠拢了 %@ m，比 A 离路的 %@ m 多出 %@ m：起始几何可能不是路网": {
      "comment": "Plausibility reason: the start was bent towards anchor A much more than A's distance from the road. 1st = taper offset in m, 2nd = A's distance from the road in m, 3rd = the excess (1st minus 2nd) in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Anfang wurde %1$@ m zu A hin gebogen, %3$@ m mehr als die %2$@ m Abstand von A zur Straße: die Anfangsgeometrie folgt womöglich nicht dem Straßennetz"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The start was bent %1$@ m towards A, %3$@ m more than A's %2$@ m from the road: the start geometry may not follow the road network"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起始段向 A 靠攏了 %1$@ m，比 A 離路的 %2$@ m 多出 %3$@ m：起始幾何可能不是路網"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "起始段向 A 靠拢了 %@ m，远多于 A 离路的 %@ m：起始几何可能不是路网": {
      "comment": "Plausibility reason: the start was bent towards anchor A much more than A's distance from the road. 1st = taper offset in m, 2nd = A's distance from the road in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Anfang wurde %@ m zu A hin gebogen, weit mehr als die %@ m Abstand von A zur Straße: die Anfangsgeometrie folgt womöglich nicht dem Straßennetz"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The start was bent %@ m towards A, far more than A's %@ m from the road: the start geometry may not follow the road network"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起始段向 A 靠攏了 %@ m，遠多於 A 離路的 %@ m：起始幾何可能不是路網"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "超时": {
