            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路網草稿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路网草稿已取回，但锚点在请求期间变了，已丢弃；请重新取": {
      "comment": "Error alert: the Road Draft arrived but the anchors changed while it was being requested, so it was discarded",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Straßenentwurf ist eingetroffen, aber die Anker haben sich während der Anfrage geändert; er wurde verworfen. Bitte erneut abrufen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Road Draft arrived, but the anchors changed during the request, so it was discarded; please fetch it again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路網草稿已取回，但錨點在請求期間變了，已丟棄；請重新取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路网草稿已取回，但锚点在这期间变了，已丢弃；请重新取": {
      "comment": "Error alert: the Road Draft arrived but the anchors changed in the meantime, so it was discarded",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Straßenentwurf ist eingetroffen, aber die Anker haben sich inzwischen geändert; er wurde verworfen. Bitte erneut abrufen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Road Draft arrived, but the anchors changed in the meantime, so it was discarded; please fetch it again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路網草稿已取回，但錨點在這期間變了，已丟棄；請重新取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路网草稿（OSRM / Valhalla）、铁路数据（Overpass）、地图判段、地名查询都要联网。判定依据：系统网络状态，以及最近 3 分钟内请求的失败/超时/耗时": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Straßenentwürfe (OSRM / Valhalla), Bahndaten (Overpass), Kartenklassifizierung und Ortsnamensuche benötigen alle Internet. Grundlage: Netzwerkstatus des Systems sowie Fehler/Zeitüberschreitungen/Dauer der Anfragen der letzten 3 Minuten"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Road drafts (OSRM / Valhalla), rail data (Overpass), map-based classification and place-name lookup all need the internet. Based on: the system network status and the failures/timeouts/durations of requests in the last 3 minutes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路網草稿（OSRM / Valhalla）、鐵路資料（Overpass）、地圖判段、地名查詢都要連網。判定依據：系統網路狀態，以及最近 3 分鐘內請求的失敗/逾時/耗時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路网路径 %@ km 远长于直线 %@ km，可能绕路或端点接错路": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning. 1st = route length in km, 2nd = straight-line distance in km; the route may detour or an end may be on the wrong road",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Straßenroute von %1$@ km ist viel länger als die Luftlinie von %2$@ km; evtl. Umweg oder ein Ende an der falschen Straße"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Road route of %1$@ km is much longer than the straight line of %2$@ km; it may detour or an end may be on the wrong road"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路網路徑 %1$@ km 遠長於直線 %2$@ km，可能繞路或端點接錯路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路网路径没有中间点（直线即可）": {
      "comment": "Road Draft warning: the route has no intermediate points (a straight line is enough)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Straßenroute hat keine Zwischenpunkte (eine Gerade genügt)"
          }
