    "近上下文（150 m 外）的路由不干净（绕路比 %@、贴路 %@/%@ m），改用远上下文（%@）：绕路比 %@、贴路 %@/%@ m": {
      "comment": "Routing note: the near-context route (from 150 m away) was not clean, the far context is used instead. 1st = near detour ratio (route length / straight line), 2nd/3rd = near snap distance to the road at A/B in m, 4th = list of far points used (e.g. \"A 前 600 m\"), 5th = far detour ratio, 6th/7th = far snap distance at A/B in m. Glossary: 上下文 = Context, 远上下文 = Far Context",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Route mit nahem Kontext (aus 150 m Entfernung) ist nicht sauber (Umwegfaktor %1$@, Anbindung %2$@/%3$@ m), daher wird „Weiter Kontext“ (%4$@) verwendet: Umwegfaktor %5$@, Anbindung %6$@/%7$@ m"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The near-context route (from 150 m away) is not clean (detour ratio %1$@, snap %2$@/%3$@ m); using Far Context (%4$@) instead: detour ratio %5$@, snap %6$@/%7$@ m"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近上下文（150 m 外）的路由不乾淨（繞路比 %1$@、貼路 %2$@/%3$@ m），改用遠上下文（%4$@）：繞路比 %5$@、貼路 %6$@/%7$@ m"
          }
        }
      }
    },
