            "value": "„%1$@“ verwendet, Anbindung %2$@ / %3$@ m"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using “%1$@”, snap %2$@ / %3$@ m"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "採用「%1$@」，貼路 %2$@ / %3$@ m"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "采用「上下文」：绕路比 %@、贴路 %@/%@ m，达标即止（批量先走上下文：/route 0.6 s，地图匹配被服务器节流到 7–9 s）": {
      "comment": "Routing note (economy mode): the Context route was clean enough and used directly. 1st = detour ratio (route length / straight line), 2nd/3rd = snap distance to the road at A/B in m. Keep /route untranslated. Glossary: 上下文 = Context",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Kontext“ verwendet: Umwegfaktor %1$@, Anbindung %2$@/%3$@ m, gut genug, Suche beendet (Stapelmodus versucht zuerst Kontext: /route 0,6 s, Kartenabgleich vom Server auf 7–9 s gedrosselt)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using “Context”: detour ratio %1$@, snap %2$@/%3$@ m, good enough, so the search stops here (batch mode tries Context first: /route takes 0.6 s, map matching is throttled by the server to 7–9 s)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "採用「上下文」：繞路比 %1$@、貼路 %2$@/%3$@ m，達標即止（批量先走上下文：/route 0.6 s，地圖匹配被伺服器節流到 7–9 s）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "采用「匹配」（A 前 %lld 点 + B 后 %lld 点，半径 %@ m）：绕路比 %@、贴路 %@/%@ m，达标即止，没再比较其它候选": {
      "comment": "Routing note (economy mode): map matching was clean enough, no other candidates compared. 1st = number of real points before A, 2nd = number of points after B, 3rd = matching radius in m, 4th = detour ratio, 5th/6th = snap distance at A/B in m. Glossary: 匹配 = Match",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Abgleich“ verwendet (%1$lld Pkt. vor A + %2$lld Pkt. nach B, Radius %3$@ m): Umwegfaktor %4$@, Anbindung %5$@/%6$@ m, gut genug, keine weiteren Kandidaten verglichen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using “Match” (%1$lld pts before A + %2$lld pts after B, radius %3$@ m): detour ratio %4$@, snap %5$@/%6$@ m, good enough, no other candidates compared"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "採用「匹配」（A 前 %1$lld 點 + B 後 %2$lld 點，半徑 %3$@ m）：繞路比 %4$@、貼路 %5$@/%6$@ m，達標即止，沒再比較其它候選"
          }
        }
      }
    },
