    "铁路只有 Overpass 一个来源，未做交叉验证": {
      "comment": "Route note in precise mode: rail geometry has a single source (Overpass), so no cross-check was possible. Keep Overpass untranslated",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schiene hat nur eine Quelle (Overpass); keine Gegenprüfung"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rail has a single source (Overpass); no cross-check performed"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鐵路只有 Overpass 一個來源，未做交叉驗證"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "铁路只补判定为隧道的断档：OSM 铁路线段自带 tunnel 标签，裁出的 A–B 路径里隧道占比 ≥50% 才补；车厢里收不到信号造成的长空洞请从 gpx.studio 导入": {
      "comment": "Batch gap fill status tooltip paragraph after the not-a-tunnel reason; ≥50% is a literal percentage; A–B = the two gap anchors",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei der Bahn werden nur als Tunnel erkannte Lücken gefüllt: OSM-Bahnabschnitte tragen ein tunnel-Tag, gefüllt wird nur, wenn Tunnel ≥50% des zugeschnittenen A–B-Wegs ausmachen; lange Löcher durch fehlenden Empfang im Zug bitte aus gpx.studio importieren"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rail only fills gaps judged to be tunnels: OSM railway segments carry a tunnel tag, and a gap is filled only if tunnels make up ≥50% of the trimmed A–B path; for long holes caused by no signal inside the train, import from gpx.studio"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鐵路只補判定為隧道的斷檔：OSM 鐵路線段自帶 tunnel 標籤，裁出的 A–B 路徑裡隧道佔比 ≥50% 才補；車廂裡收不到訊號造成的長空洞請從 gpx.studio 匯入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "铁路断档只补判定为隧道的：A–B 铁路路径里 OSM tunnel 标签段占 ≥50%，且直线 ≤60 km、时长 ≤25 分钟。其余多半是车厢里收不到信号，不补，需要的话从 gpx.studio 导": {
      "comment": "Help for the rail-not-a-tunnel count in the batch quality bar; ≥50% is a literal percentage; A–B = the two gap anchors",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bahnlücken werden nur gefüllt, wenn sie als Tunnel erkannt sind: Abschnitte mit OSM-tunnel-Tag machen ≥50% des A–B-Bahnwegs aus, Luftlinie ≤60 km, Dauer ≤25 min. Der Rest ist meist fehlender Empfang im Zug und wird nicht gefüllt; bei Bedarf aus gpx.studio importieren"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rail gaps are filled only if judged to be tunnels: segments with the OSM tunnel tag make up ≥50% of the A–B rail path, the straight line is ≤60 km and the duration ≤25 min. The rest are mostly no signal inside the train and are not filled; import them from gpx.studio if needed"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鐵路斷檔只補判定為隧道的：A–B 鐵路路徑裡 OSM tunnel 標籤段佔 ≥50%，且直線 ≤60 km、時長 ≤25 分鐘。其餘多半是車廂裡收不到訊號，不補，需要的話從 gpx.studio 匯入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "铁路路径 %@ km 远长于直线 %@ km，可能绕路或接错线": {
      "comment": "Reason a rail gap is not filled. 1st = rail path length in km, 2nd = straight-line distance in km; may detour or be attached to the wrong line",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Bahnweg (%1$@ km) ist viel länger als die Luftlinie (%2$@ km); evtl. Umweg oder falsche Strecke"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rail path (%1$@ km) is much longer than the straight line (%2$@ km); it may detour or follow the wrong line"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鐵路路徑 %1$@ km 遠長於直線 %2$@ km，可能繞路或接錯線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "铁路路径 %@ km（OSM railway，隧道标签逐段）：隧道占 %@%%（%@ km），不到 50%%": {
      "comment": "Rail routing note, tunnel share below 50 %. 1st = rail path length in km, 2nd = tunnel share in percent (followed by a literal %), 3rd = tunnel length in km. Keep \"OSM railway\" (the OSM tag) untranslated",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bahnweg %1$@ km (OSM railway, Tunnel-Tags je Abschnitt): Tunnelanteil %2$@%% (%3$@ km), unter 50%%"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rail path %1$@ km (OSM railway, tunnel tags per segment): tunnel share %2$@%% (%3$@ km), below 50%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鐵路路徑 %1$@ km（OSM railway，隧道標籤逐段）：隧道佔 %2$@%%（%3$@ km），不到 50%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "铁路路径 %@ km（OSM railway，隧道标签逐段）：隧道占 %@%%（%@ km），达到 50%%": {
      "comment": "Rail routing note, tunnel share reaches 50 %. 1st = rail path length in km, 2nd = tunnel share in percent (followed by a literal %), 3rd = tunnel length in km. Keep \"OSM railway\" (the OSM tag) untranslated",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bahnweg %1$@ km (OSM railway, Tunnel-Tags je Abschnitt): Tunnelanteil %2$@%% (%3$@ km), mindestens 50%%"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
