    "锚点 %@ 离路网 %@ m（这类设备通常 ≤5 m）：补点沿路网走，会和真实轨迹差这么多": {
      "comment": "Plausibility reason (mild): the anchor is further from the road than typical for this device, so the filled points (which follow the road) will differ from the real track by about that much. 1st = anchor letter A or B, 2nd = distance in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ankerpunkt %@ liegt %@ m vom Straßennetz entfernt (bei diesem Gerät meist ≤5 m): die eingefügten Punkte folgen der Straße und weichen daher etwa so weit von der echten Spur ab"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anchor %@ is %@ m from the road network (usually ≤5 m for this device): the filled points follow the road, so they will differ from the real track by about that much"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錨點 %@ 離路網 %@ m（這類裝置通常 ≤5 m）：補點沿路網走，會和真實軌跡差這麼多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "锚点 A 离路网 %@ m": {
      "comment": "Plausibility reason: anchor A is far from the road network. %@ = distance in m",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ankerpunkt A liegt %@ m vom Straßennetz entfernt"
