    "锚点本身吸到了别的路（直接路由 %@ km），已按前后轨迹走向纠正": {
      "comment": "Road-draft warning: the anchor itself snapped to another road; corrected using the track before/after. %@ = length of the direct route in km",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Anker selbst ist an einer anderen Straße eingerastet (direkte Route %@ km); anhand des Trackverlaufs davor und danach korrigiert"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The anchor itself snapped to another road (direct route %@ km); corrected using the direction of the track before and after"
