    "隧道之间有 %@ km 露天线路一个点都没有（隧道占 %@%%），更像车厢里没信号": {
      "comment": "Reason a rail gap is not filled. 1st = length in km of open-air track between tunnels without any point, 2nd = tunnel share in percent (followed by a literal %); looks like no signal inside the train",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ km offene Strecke zwischen Tunneln ganz ohne Punkte (Tunnelanteil %2$@%%); eher kein Signal im Zug"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ km of open-air track between tunnels has no points at all (tunnel share %2$@%%); more like no signal inside the train"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道之間有 %1$@ km 露天線路一個點都沒有（隧道佔 %2$@%%），更像車廂裡沒訊號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隧道口外 %@ km 露天线路没有点（出隧道后重新定位不该这么久），更像车厢里没信号": {
      "comment": "Reason a rail gap is not filled. %@ = length in km of open-air track outside the tunnel portal without points (re-acquiring GPS after a tunnel should not take that long)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
